WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:32.091
Tom and Cat were walking in the rain.

2
00:00:32.092 --> 00:00:39.065
The new jester was at the blacksmith shop.

3
00:00:39.066 --> 00:00:43.153
"Why isn't the jester practicing?" asked Tom.

4
00:00:43.154 --> 00:00:46.395
"The Grand Banquet is tomorrow!"

5
00:00:46.396 --> 00:00:50.771
"Maybe he needs tin plates to juggle," Cat said.

6
00:00:50.772 --> 00:00:53.471
"True," Tom said.

7
00:00:53.472 --> 00:00:57.249
"He can't break more of the queen's dishes!"

8
00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:09.910
But the jester did not buy tin plates.

9
00:01:09.911 --> 00:01:18.998
The jester was just taking a walk.

10
00:01:18.999 --> 00:01:27.206
Suddenly he stopped near the castle wall.

11
00:01:27.207 --> 00:01:34.608
He looked closely at a crack.

12
00:01:34.609 --> 00:01:37.634
"That's strange," Cat said.

13
00:01:37.635 --> 00:01:41.026
"The jester looks worried," Tom said.

14
00:01:41.027 --> 00:01:43.172
"Maybe I can help."

15
00:01:43.173 --> 00:01:49.849
"You have a kind heart," Cat said.

16
00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.835
"Jester!" Tom called.

17
00:01:52.836 --> 00:01:55.524
The jester jumped.

18
00:01:55.525 --> 00:01:58.055
He looked ready to run away.

19
00:01:58.056 --> 00:02:03.461
"Stop! I want to help," Tom said.

20
00:02:03.462 --> 00:02:07.357
The jester looked sad.

21
00:02:07.358 --> 00:02:10.552
"I'm Tink the Tinker," he said.

22
00:02:10.553 --> 00:02:12.527
"I fix things.

23
00:02:12.528 --> 00:02:15.018
I don't know how to be a jester."

24
00:02:15.019 --> 00:02:17.392
"It's easy," Tom said.

25
00:02:17.393 --> 00:02:22.542
"Jump into the air and flip around."

26
00:02:22.543 --> 00:02:24.640
Tink jumped and flipped.

27
00:02:24.641 --> 00:02:26.854
Then he flopped.

28
00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:29.407
"Oops," Tom said.

29
00:02:29.408 --> 00:02:35.152
"Try dancing a jig instead."

30
00:02:35.153 --> 00:02:44.432
Tink danced.

31
00:02:44.433 --> 00:02:51.258
He knocked over a pile of tomatoes.

32
00:02:51.259 --> 00:02:56.431
"Dirk is going to be very mad!" Tink said.

33
00:02:56.432 --> 00:03:04.481
He hurried away.

34
00:03:04.482 --> 00:03:06.880
Cat licked her paws.

35
00:03:06.881 --> 00:03:12.851
"The Grand Banquet will be interesting," she said.
